00FF,&H002FıAAF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: Translation,Duality,65,&H002FıAAF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Kanji,Duality,65,&H002FıAAF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,120,1Style: Sign - Map,Roboto,35,&H00000000,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,0,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextComment: 5,0:10:08.37,0:10:09.69,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.49,Title,,0,0,0,,A Gentle Snowfall of RemembranceDialogue: 5,0:00:00.76,0:00:04.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, hey, hey! Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Usopp?!Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.76,0:00:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.61,0:00:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? He’s not up here?Dialogue: 5,0:00:13.89,0:00:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.51,0:00:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.57,0:00:19.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Usopp?!Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's calling for you.Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.04,0:00:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I couldn’t possibly show my face now.Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean it! Come out already!Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.71,0:00:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't come out, I'm gonna beat the crap outta you!Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.06,0:00:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna beat the crap outta you!Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.42,0:00:40.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know where Usopp is, Sogeking? I can't find him anywhere!Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.99,0:00:45.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Don't worry. He departed on a small boat, just before we did.Dialogue: 5,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.05,0:00:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 5,0:00:48.44,0:00:51.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this ship actually belongs to him now.Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.40,0:00:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell do they not recognize that he’s Usopp?Dialogue: 5,0:00:59.11,0:01:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not here, either.Dialogue: 5,0:01:02.09,0:01:04.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 5,0:01:07.64,0:01:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It’s as we thought. There isn’t anyone anywhere on this ship.Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.30,0:01:12.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's strange.Dialogue: 5,0:01:12.34,0:01:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder who could’ve sailed this ship to us.Dialogue: 5,0:01:15.00,0:01:19.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we all heard the same voice calling out to us.Dialogue: 5,0:01:19.86,0:01:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did?Dialogue: 5,0:01:21.48,0:01:24.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, someone most certainly called to us.Dialogue: 5,0:01:24.14,0:01:28.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I’ve been saying, it was the Merry's voice!Dialogue: 5,0:01:29.40,0:01:31.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Really?!Dialogue: 5,0:01:33.57,0:01:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Merry?! Say something!Dialogue: 5,0:01:36.50,0:01:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot. There's no way a ship could talk.Dialogue: 5,0:01:39.80,0:01:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I kinda felt that way at first,Dialogue: 5,0:01:45.11,0:01:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but something like that should be impossible, right?Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.82,0:02:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There’s a ship heading toward us!Dialogue: 5,0:02:01.81,0:02:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?! Who's that?!Dialogue: 5,0:02:05.40,0:02:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 5,0:02:06.74,0:02:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're alive!Dialogue: 5,0:02:07.81,0:02:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you guys're okay!Dialogue: 5,0:02:10.58,0:02:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Galley-La Company ship?Dialogue: 5,0:02:12.82,0:02:14.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!Dialogue: 5,0:02:14.16,0:02:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They rushed out in the middle of Aqua Laguna and still made it okay! I can't believe it!Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.59,0:02:21.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They came back from Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 5,0:02:22.78,0:02:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahoy, Iceboss!Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.87,0:02:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid-burg.Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.99,0:02:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:02:37.27,0:02:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a crazy bunch.Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.61,0:02:41.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They took on the World Government...Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.25,0:02:51.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and really got everything back.Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! Their ship!Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?! What happened all of a sudden?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:14.63,0:03:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden? Isn't it only natural?Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:03:20.26,0:03:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Merry was declared unfit for the seas.Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.19,0:03:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But!Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.80,0:03:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss! This is bad! Merry is in trouble! You gotta do something!Dialogue: 5,0:03:37.65,0:03:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys, this is great timing! You're all shipwrights, right?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.95,0:03:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you! Please do something!Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.45,0:03:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's our friend and has traveled with us for so long!Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.12,0:03:49.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And just a bit ago she saved us!Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.45,0:03:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So please, boss!Dialogue: 5,0:03:54.08,0:03:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then allow her...Dialogue: 5,0:03:58.11,0:03:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to rest now.Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.50,0:04:06.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've already done everything I could.Dialogue: 5,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.57,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?Dialogue: 5,0:04:22.00,0:04:24.36,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Is someone on Scrap Island?Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.18,0:04:31.47,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the Straw Hats' ship?Dialogue: 5,0:04:33.88,0:04:37.38,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,The damage from Aqua Laguna left her in bad shape.Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.79,0:04:42.88,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,No, she was like this before the storm.Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.45,0:04:45.84,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I want to set sail.Dialogue: 5,0:04:48.10,0:04:49.06,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What was that?Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.14,0:04:57.31,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I want to set sail one last time!Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.27,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.27,0:05:28.51,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,There's no hope left for this ship.Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.80,0:05:32.18,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san!Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.74,0:05:36.73,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?! Another big wave is coming!Dialogue: 5,0:05:43.17,0:05:44.62,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.05,0:06:10.09,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What?! You want to set sail?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.05,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,The storm hasn’t let up yet!Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.74,0:06:14.31,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I'll go alone if I have to.Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.69,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:15.69,0:06:18.36,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Then we can't let you go out there all by yourself!Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.00,0:06:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm witnessing a miracle right now:Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.38,0:06:28.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The miracle of a ship  that has long passed its limits.Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.41,0:06:33.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In all my years as a shipwright,Dialogue: 5,0:06:34.47,0:06:37.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a pirate ship this remarkable.Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.29,0:06:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's lived a splendid life.Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.42,0:06:51.97,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let’s go back!Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.14,0:06:57.91,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Back to the seas of adventure!Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.69,0:07:01.15,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.69,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I came to get you!Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.20,0:07:22.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it.Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.76,0:08:24.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, are you guys ready?Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.06,0:08:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:08:32.78,0:08:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merry, the seabed is dark and lonesome,Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.90,0:08:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we’ll see you off to the very end.Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.00,0:08:46.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's for the best that Usopp isn't here.Dialogue: 5,0:08:46.00,0:08:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way... that he could bear this.Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.26,0:08:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any thoughts?Dialogue: 5,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I disagree.Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.50,0:08:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone must someday say farewell. This is a man's parting.Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.06,0:09:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mustn’t shed a single tear.Dialogue: 5,0:09:05.60,0:09:08.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he, too, is prepared.Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.15,0:09:44.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You carried us for so long. Thank you, Merry.Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.92,0:09:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Snow!Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.69,0:10:10.99,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,A caravel!Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.99,0:10:12.63,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.46,0:10:20.80,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Now the pirate ship, the Going Merry, is complete!Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.39,0:10:24.80,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Cheers to our new ship and crewmate!Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.34,0:10:36.96,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Look at this! The Merry took quite a bit of damage!Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.96,0:10:39.24,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,When operating a ship with sails, everyone needs to do their part!Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.00,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,You need to remember that!Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.00,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.37,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Ih'm shorree.Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.67,0:10:47.43,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?Dialogue: 5,0:10:47.43,0:10:49.52,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Cannon practice!Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.52,0:10:51.25,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,They sure don't fly too good!Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.25,0:10:53.96,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, let me try!Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.46,0:10:59.92,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Awesome! You hit it on your first try!Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.92,0:11:03.64,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Whoa! I really hit it on my first try!Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.39,0:11:20.78,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Hey! That's my seat!Dialogue: 5,0:11:21.70,0:11:24.78,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,The entrance to the Grand Line lies just beyond that light.Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.18,0:11:29.12,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,To find the All Blue!Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.19,0:11:31.96,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,To be king of the pirates!Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.00,0:11:34.79,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,To become the greatest swordsman!Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.90,0:11:38.55,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,To draw a world map!Dialogue: 5,0:11:39.00,0:11:43.26,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,T-To become a brave warrior of the sea!Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.33,0:11:48.66,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,On to the Grand Line!Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.65,0:11:59.78,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,The entrance to the Grand Line is a mountain!Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.75,0:12:01.99,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,A mountain?Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.95,0:12:20.55,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,We made it!Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.88,0:12:23.68,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,This is the greatest sea in the world!Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.76,0:12:27.41,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Keep going!Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.99,0:12:52.50,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,We're flying right out of it!Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.25,0:12:57.91,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Don't look back! We're keeping on straight ahead!Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.49,0:13:07.59,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Let me join your crew.Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.92,0:13:11.20,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I have nowhere to go and no place to call home.Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.42,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,So let me stay on this ship.Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.42,0:13:16.92,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Then I guess we have no choice.Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:17.50,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 5,0:13:17.50,0:13:18.48,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.38,0:13:21.53,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Who's this ship's navigator?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.20,0:13:24.49,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,We're flying!Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.49,0:13:28.68,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Awesome! The ship is flying!Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.12,0:13:35.41,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,It's Sky Island!Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.44,0:14:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry;Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.36,0:15:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted to carry you even further.Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry;Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.72,0:15:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted to share adventures with you forever.Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.60,0:15:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.71,0:15:21.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A voice!Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I–Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.18,0:15:30.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We’re the ones who need to apologize, Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.08,0:15:33.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not good at steering,Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.77,0:15:36.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I sometimes ran you into icebergs.Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.20,0:15:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I also once ripped your sails!Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.27,0:15:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro and Sanji act stupid together, so they broke all sorts of things!Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.80,0:15:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp would fix you each time, but he wasn’t very good at it!Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we’re the ones who need to apologize!Dialogue: 5,0:16:01.58,0:16:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I've been happy.Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.70,0:16:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much for taking good care of me all this time.Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.74,0:16:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I really have been happy...Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.75,0:16:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because I had you.Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.81,0:16:44.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merry!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:45.15,Credits,c,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack, Zenef  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 5,0:10:09.88,0:10:19.02,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,We spent every day covered in mud until the sun setDialogue: 5,0:10:19.12,0:10:28.22,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,It's hard to leave behind those innocent daysDialogue: 5,0:10:29.01,0:10:38.52,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer because that's who I amDialogue: 5,0:10:38.67,0:10:47.14,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,I don't need to fit in like a piece of a jigsaw puzzleDialogue: 5,0:10:47.76,0:10:57.04,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,Just as someone's "Yes" could be a "No" to you,Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.04,0:11:07.16,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,You should always be freeDialogue: 5,0:11:07.16,0:11:17.29,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,If the puzzle is missing a piece when the wind passes through tomorrow,Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.29,0:11:26.18,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,no one would blame you for thatDialogue: 5,0:11:26.18,0:11:31.79,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,We knew we weren't wrongDialogue: 5,0:11:31.79,0:11:36.41,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,For the dreams we had beforeDialogue: 5,0:11:36.41,0:11:45.66,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,That helps us cross a wildly surging oceanDialogue: 5,0:11:45.66,0:11:55.16,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,We know the pain that's in your heart,Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.16,0:12:05.04,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,so even if you were to get off this ship and find yourself on the other side,Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.04,0:12:14.95,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,you'll surely smile in the end.Dialogue: 5,0:13:17.25,0:13:26.95,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,We still have our dreamsDialogue: 5,0:13:26.95,0:13:37.16,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,And the memories given to usDialogue: 5,0:13:37.16,0:13:46.20,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,Today, we continue fighting the pain as we cross these rough seasDialogue: 5,0:13:46.20,0:13:54.41,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,So that our promises won't become liesDialogue: 5,0:13:54.41,0:14:05.37,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,And someday, to you who departed our ship to live on the other side,Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.37,0:14:16.08,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,we'll deliver a completed puzzle